Package: qore-odbc-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-odbc-module-doc, odbc-postgresql
Description: ODBC database driver for Qore
 This module connects Qore's DBI API to ODBC databases through unixODBC.
 It supports prepared statements, array binding, transactions, Unicode and
 large values. Install an ODBC driver for the target database separately.

Package: qore-odbc-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-odbc-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's ODBC driver
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 ODBC database driver.
